1. Islam kya hai (Taaruf, Aqaid, Tauheed, Kalima)
Islam ka matlab jhuk jana, salamti. Istilah mein: Allah ke hukm ko dil se maan lena. Islam mukammal zabta-e-hayat hai: ibadat, karobar, siyasat, akhlaq, huqooq.
6 aqaid: Tauheed, Risalat, Akhirat, Farishte, Kitaben, Taqdeer. Tauheed: Allah ek hai, zaat, sifaat aur hukm mein koi uska sharik nahi; taqaze: ibadat, madad, hukm sirf Allah ka. Iska ulta Shirk hai. Tauheed ki surah: Surah Ikhlas.
Kalima Tayyiba: La ilaha illallah, Muhammadur Rasoolullah. Maqsad: sirf Allah ko ek manna aur Nabi ki itaat karna.
Iman-e-Mufassal mein 7 cheezen: Allah, Farishte, Kitaben, Rasool, Akhirat, Taqdeer, maut ke baad dobara uthna. Iman-e-Mujmal chhota iqrar hai.
2. Namaz aur Roza
Namaz Meraj ki raat farz hui (5 waqt). Namaz ke bahar 7 sharten: paaki, libas, jagah, waqt, qibla, niyat, takbeer-e-tehrima. Namaz ke andar 6 farz: qiyam, qirat, ruku, sajda, qaida-e-akhira, salam. Wuzu ke 4 farz: chehra dhona, kohniyon samet haath dhona, chauthai sar ka masah, takhnon samet pair dhona. Ghusl ke 3 farz: kulli, naak mein paani daalna, poore jism ko dhona.
Namaz-e-Janaza: 4 takbeerein (Sana, Durood, marhoom ki dua, salam).
Roza 2 Hijri mein farz hua, Surah Baqarah mein hukm hai. Sehri se ghuroob tak khane, peene aur biwi se talluq se rukna. Faide: sabr, taqwa, ghareebon ka ehsas, sehat, discipline. Qasdan tore to kaffara: 60 roze lagatar ya 60 miskeenon ko khana khilana.
3. Zakat aur Hajj
Zakat 2 Hijri mein farz hui. Nisab 7.5 tola sona ya 52.5 tola chandi, shara 2.5%. Zakat ke 8 masarif: faqeer, miskeen, amil, muallafatul quloob, ghulam, qarzdar, fi sabilillah, musafir.
Hajj (qasd = ziyarat ka irada), aam qaul ke mutabiq 9 Hijri mein farz hua. Nabi ne 1 Hajj aur 4 Umrah kiye.
Tarteeb: Ehram aur Talbiya → Tawaf (7 chakkar) → Sai (Safa-Marwa ke 7 chakkar) → 8 Zul Hijjah ko Mina → 9 ko Arafat (sab se bara farz), raat Muzdalifa mein → 10 ko Rami, qurbani, sar mundwana, Tawaf-e-Ziyarat → 11–12 ko Mina, phir Tawaf-e-Wida. 3 farz: ehram, Arafat mein wuquf, Tawaf-e-Ziyarat. Dam = ghalti par qurbani.
Zamzam: Ibrahim (alaihis salam) ne Hajira aur Ismail ko Makka mein chhoda; Hajira ne Safa-Marwa ke beech 7 chakkar lagaye aur Zamzam phoot nikla. Isi ki yaad mein Sai hoti hai.
4. Quran ki Kahani
114 surah, 30 paray, 7 manzilen, 14 sajde.
• Sab se lambi surah: Baqarah (286 ayat). Sab se chhoti: Kausar (3 ayat). Sab se lambi ayat: Ayat-ud-Dain.
• Quran ka dil: Yaseen. Quran ki dulhan: Surah Rehman. Ayat-ul-Kursi: Baqarah 255. Surah Nisa: aurton, yateem aur wirasat ke ahkam.
• Kausar: Nabi ke bete guzre to Aas bin Wail ne "abtar" kaha; Allah ne Kausar ata ki aur farmaya ke abtar to tumhara dushman hai.
• Feel: Abraha hathiyon ka lashkar le kar Kaaba dhaane aaya; ababeel parindon ki kankariyon se tabah hua. Isi saal Nabi ki paidaish hui (Aam-ul-Feel).
• Anfal: Jang-e-Badr aur ghanimat ke ahkam.
• Sab se zyada naam: Moosa (alaihis salam). Muhammad naam 4 baar, 25 anbiya ka zikr.
• Janwaron ke naam par surah: Naml, Nahl, Ankabut, Feel, Baqarah.
5. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka Bachpan aur Makka
Paidaish 12 Rabi-ul-Awwal ko Makka mein, Aam-ul-Feel mein. Walid Abdullah pehle hi guzar gaye. Halima Saadia ne doodh pilaya. Walida Amina 6 saal ki umar mein guzar gayin, phir dada Abdul Muttalib ne parvarish ki, phir chacha Abu Talib ne.
Jahiliyat: betiyon ko zinda dafan karna, sood, sharab, jua, qabaili jhagde, ghulami.
40 saal ki umar mein Ghaar-e-Hira (Jabal-e-Noor) mein pehli wahi: "Iqra". Sab se pehle imaan laye: Khadija, Abu Bakr, Ali, Zaid bin Haritha. Banu Hashim, pardada Hashim ke naam par.
Shib-e-Abi Talib: 3 saal ka bayqot. Phir Abu Talib aur Khadija ka intiqal hua (Aam-ul-Huzn). Taif: Zaid bin Haritha ke saath gaye, ladkon ne patthar maray; farishte ne pahaar milane ki baat ki, Nabi ne farmaya: nahi, shayad inki nasl Islam laaye. Pehli hijrat Habsha ki taraf (5 Nabuwat): Usman aur Ruqayya shamil thay, Najashi ne panah di.
6. Hijrat-e-Madina
622 AD. Wajah: Makka mein zulm, aur Madina ke Ansar ki bait aur madad. Nabi aur Abu Bakr Ghaar-e-Saur mein 3 din rahe. Mojize: makri ka jala, kabootar ka ghonsla, Suraqa bin Malik ke ghoray ke paon zameen mein dhans gaye, Umm Mabad ki bakri ne doodh diya. Pehle Quba pohanche (Masjid-e-Quba, Islam ki pehli masjid). Madina mein 3 kaam: Masjid-e-Nabvi, Muwakhat (Muhajir-Ansar bhai bhai), Meesaq-e-Madina (47 shaqein). Nabi Madina mein 10 saal rahe.
Fatah Makka ki wajah (8 Hijri): Quraish ne Hudaibiya ka muahida tora.
7. Ghazwat — Poori Tafseel (8 Mashhoor Ghazwat)
Ghazwa = wo jang jis mein Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khud shareek hon. Sariyya = wo muhim jis mein Nabi khud nahi gaye, sahaba ko bheja. Nabi ki zindagi mein taqreeban 27 ghazwat hue, jin mein taqreeban 9 mein asal jang hui.
Yaad rakhne ka tareeqa (lashkar ki ginti): Badr 313 → Uhud 700 → Khandaq 3,000 → Khaibar 1,400 → Makka 10,000 → Hunain 12,000 → Tabuk 30,000. Ginti mein riwayaton ke mutabiq thoda farq milta hai; interview mein mashhoor aadad batao.
Ghazwa 1: BADR (17 Ramzan, 2 Hijri ≈ 624 AD)
Ramzan ke mahine ki 17 tareekh thi, 2 Hijri. Quraish ka bara tijarati qafila Sham se Makka wapas aa raha tha, aur uska sardar Abu Sufyan tha. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne saathiyon ke saath is qafile ko rokne ka irada kiya, kyunke Quraish ne Makka mein Musalmanon ka ghar-bar aur maal sab chheen liya tha. Abu Sufyan ko is ka pata chal gaya, us ne raasta badal liya aur Makka paighaam bheja ke fauran madad bhejo. Is par Abu Jahl, jis ka asal naam Amr bin Hisham tha, taqreeban ek hazaar ka lashkar le kar nikal para. Is lashkar mein sau ghoray, saat sau oont aur chhe sau zirahein thin, aur Utba, Shaiba, Waleed bin Utba aur Umayya bin Khalaf jaise bade sardar saath thay.
Doosri taraf Nabi ke saath sirf 313 saathi thay. Unke paas sirf do ghoray thay, jin par Zubair bin Awwam aur Miqdad bin Aswad sawar thay, aur sattar oont thay, jin par do do teen teen aadmi baari baari sawar hote thay. Zirahein sirf chhe aur talwarein bhi gine chune thin. Phir bhi imaan ki taqat bohat badi thi. Badr ke maqam par kuen thay, aur Hubab bin Mundhir ne mashwara diya ke hum sab se aage wale kuen par qabza kar len aur baqi kuen band kar den. Nabi ne yeh mashwara qabool kiya, aur is tarah Musalmanon ke paas paani raha aur dushman pyaasa raha.
Jang ki shuruaat us zamane ke dastoor ke mutabiq aamne saamne ke muqable se hui. Quraish ke teen bahadur Utba, Shaiba aur Waleed nikle. Musalmanon ki taraf se Hamza ne Shaiba ko mara, Ali ne Waleed ko mara, aur Ubaida bin Harith Utba se lar kar zakhmi hue. Phir Hamza aur Ali ne mil kar Utba ko bhi khatam kiya. Is ke baad aam jang hui. Abu Jahl ko do Ansari naujawan, Muaz bin Amr aur Muaz bin Afra, ne zakhmi kiya, aur baad mein Abdullah bin Masood ne us ka khatma kiya. Umayya bin Khalaf, jis ne Bilal ko garm ret par litaya tha, Bilal aur Ansar ke haath se mara gaya.
Aakhir mein Allah ne Musalmanon ko fatah di. Dushman ke sattar log maray gaye aur sattar qaidi bane. Musalmanon ke chaudah log shaheed hue, jin mein chhe Muhajir aur aath Ansar thay. Qaidiyon ke saath narmi ka sulook hua. Jo maal de sakte thay unhon ne fidya diya, aur jo parhe likhe thay unhon ne Ansar ke das bachon ko likhna parhna sikhaya. Is jang ko Youm-ul-Furqan kehte hain, yani haq aur batil ke farq ka din, aur is ka zikr Surah Anfal mein hai. Sabaq yeh hai ke kam saaman ke bawajood imaan, sabr aur Allah par bharosa fatah dilata hai.
Ghazwa 2: UHUD (Shawwal, 3 Hijri ≈ 625 AD)
Shawwal ka mahina tha, 3 Hijri. Badr mein shikast ke baad Quraish ke dil mein badle ki aag jal rahi thi. Abu Sufyan ne tijarati qafile ka nafa jama kiya aur teen hazaar ka bara lashkar tayyar kiya, jis mein do sau ghoray, teen hazaar oont aur saat sau zirahein thin. Unki aurtein bhi saath aayin, jin mein Abu Sufyan ki biwi Hind bint Utba bhi thi, taake mard jazbe se lare. Lashkar ke sipah-salar Abu Sufyan thay, ghoron ke dasto mein seedhe hath par Khalid bin Waleed aur ulte hath par Ikrima bin Abu Jahl thay, aur jhanda Talha bin Abi Talha ke paas tha. Yeh log Madina ke shumal mein taqreeban paanch kilometer door Uhud pahaar ke paas aa kar thehre.
Nabi ne sahaba se mashwara kiya aur naujawano ke josh par Madina se bahar nikal kar muqabla karne ka faisla hua. Ek hazaar ka lashkar nikla, magar raaste mein munafiq sardar Abdullah bin Ubayy teen sau saathiyon ko le kar wapas ho gaya aur sirf saat sau Musalman reh gaye. Unke paas sirf do ghoray aur thori si zirahein thin. Jhanda Musab bin Umair ke haath mein tha. Nabi ne pahaar ki ek ghati par pachas teer-andazon ko Abdullah bin Jubair ki sarbarahi mein bithaya aur saaf hukm diya ke chahe hum jeetein ya haarein, tum yeh jagah mat chhorna.
Jang shuru hui to Musalman jeetne lage. Ali ne jhanda bardar Talha bin Abi Talha ko mara, aur Abu Dujana ne apni talwar se dushman ki safein ulat deen. Quraish ke qadam ukhar gaye aur woh bhaagne lage. Yeh dekh kar teer-andazon ne socha ke jang khatam ho gayi aur maal-e-ghanimat samaitne ke liye pahaar chhor diya, halan ke Abdullah bin Jubair ne unhein roka. Khalid bin Waleed ne, jo us waqt tak Quraish ki taraf thay, yeh khaali jagah dekh li aur peechay se achanak hamla kar diya. Musalmanon ki safein bikhar gayin.
Is afra-tafri mein Hamza ko Wahshi bin Harb ne, Hind ke inaam ke lalach mein, neze se shaheed kiya. Nabi ke chehre par zakhm aaye, ek dandan mubarak shaheed hua aur sar mubarak par zirah ki kadiyan chubh gayin. Talha bin Ubaidullah, Abu Dujana, Saad bin Abi Waqqas aur Nusaiba, jo Umm Ammara kehlati thin, ne Nabi ki hifazat ki. Ubayy bin Khalaf ne Nabi par hamla karna chaha to Nabi ne khud neze se use zakhmi kiya aur wo bhaag kar mara. Is dauran yeh afwah phail gayi ke Nabi shaheed ho gaye, to Kaab bin Malik ne Nabi ko pehchaan kar bulandi se pukara ke Musalmano, khushkhabri ho, Allah ke Rasool zinda hain.
Is jang mein sattar Musalman shaheed hue, jin mein chaar Muhajir aur chhiyasath Ansar thay, aur Hamza, Musab bin Umair aur Abdullah bin Jahsh bhi shaheed hue. Dushman ke taqreeban baais se saintees log maray gaye. Quraish wapas chale gaye aur Madina par hamla nahi kiya. Agle din Nabi ne unka peecha karne ke liye Hamra-ul-Asad tak safar kiya taake dushman dobara hamla na kare. Sabaq yeh hai ke Nabi ke hukm ki itaat zaroori hai aur maal ka lalach nuqsan deta hai.
Ghazwa 3: KHANDAQ / AHZAB (Shawwal, 5 Hijri ≈ 627 AD)
Shawwal ka mahina tha, 5 Hijri. Banu Nadir ke Yahoodi sardar, jinhein Madina se nikala gaya tha, Makka gaye aur Quraish ko Musalmanon par hamle ke liye ubhara. Quraish ne Ghatafan, Banu Sulaim, Banu Asad aur doosre qabail ko saath mila liya, aur is tarah dus hazaar ka bara lashkar bana, jis ka naam Ahzab yani gurohon ka ittehad pada. Quraish ke sipah-salar Abu Sufyan thay aur Ghatafan ke sardar Uyaina bin Hisn thay. Dushman ke paas taqreeban chhe sau ghoray thay.
Madina mein Musalman sirf teen hazaar thay. Salman Farsi ne, jo Iran ke rehne wale thay, mashwara diya ke shehr ke us hisse mein, jahan se dushman ghus sakta hai, ek gehri khandaq khodi jaye, kyunke Arab is tareeqe se waqif nahi thay. Nabi ne yeh mashwara pasand kiya. Taqreeban paanch kilometer lambi khandaq chhe din mein khodi gayi. Nabi ne khud bhi kudal chalayi aur bhook ki wajah se apne pait par patthar bandhe. Ek sakht chattan nahi tootti thi, Nabi ne teen zarbein lagayin to woh toot gayi aur har zarb par Allah ne fatah ki khushkhabri di.
Dushman ne Madina ko gher liya, magar khandaq dekh kar hairan reh gaya. Isi dauran Madina ke Yahoodi qabeele Banu Quraiza ne muahida tod diya aur dushman se mil gaye, jis se Musalmanon ki mushkilat bohat barh gayin. Kuch Quraishi pehlwan, Amr bin Abd Wudd, Ikrima aur Naufal, ne khandaq ke tang hisse se apne ghoray kuda diye. Ali ne Amr bin Abd Wudd se muqabla kar ke use mar diya, aur Naufal khandaq mein gir kar mara gaya.
Us waqt naye Musalman Nuaym bin Masood ne hikmat se Quraiza aur Quraish ke beech ghalat fehmi daal di, aur dono ne ek doosre par bharosa chhor diya. Taqreeban ek mahine ke gherao ke baad, ek raat sakht aandhi aur thandi hawa chali jis se dushman ke khaime ukhar gaye aur chulhe bujh gaye. Abu Sufyan ne wapsi ka elaan kar diya. Musalmanon ke taqreeban chhe log shaheed hue, jin mein Saad bin Muaz teer se zakhmi hue aur baad mein shaheed hue. Dushman ke teen chaar log maray gaye. Nabi ne farmaya ke ab hum un par charhai karenge, woh hum par nahi karenge. Sabaq yeh hai ke jang mein hikmat, mashwara aur sabr aham hain.
Baqi paanch Ghazwat
Ghazwa 4: BANU QURAIZA (Zul Qaada–Zul Hijjah, 5 Hijri, Khandaq ke foran baad)
Khandaq ki jang khatam hui to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne abhi hathiyar utare hi thay ke Jibreel (alaihis salam) haazir hue aur farmaya ke Allah ka hukm hai, Banu Quraiza ka muamla aaj hi nipta diya jaye. Banu Quraiza Madina ke Yahoodi qabeele thay, jinhon ne Meesaq-e-Madina ke muahide ke bawajood Khandaq ke sakht din mein dushman se saazish ki thi aur Musalmanon ki peeth mein khanjar ghonpne ki koshish ki thi. Nabi ne Ali ko jhanda diya aur elaan karwaya ke koi bhi asr ki namaz Banu Quraiza ki basti pohanch kar hi parhe. Taqreeban teen hazaar Musalmanon ka lashkar, jis mein chhatees ghoray thay, un ke qilon ki taraf rawana hua. Un ke sardar Kaab bin Asad thay.
Yahoodiyon ne qilon ke darwaze band kar liye aur andar se muqabla karne ki thaan li. Kaab bin Asad ne apni qaum ko teen raaste batay: Islam qabool kar lo, ya apne bachon ko qatl kar ke aakhri hamla karo, ya sabt ke din achanak hamla kar do. Magar un mein se kisi par bhi woh razi na hue. Taqreeban pachees din tak gherao raha. Aakhir ghabra kar unhon ne hathiyar daal diye aur Nabi se sulah ki guzarish ki.
Un ke purane ittehadi Aws qabeele ne Nabi se narmi ki darkhwast ki, to Nabi ne farmaya ke tum chaho to tumhare apne sardar Saad bin Muaz faisla karen. Yahoodi bhi is par razi ho gaye. Saad bin Muaz, jo Khandaq mein teer lagne se zakhmi thay, sawari par laye gaye. Unhon ne dono taraf se pakka wada le kar faisla diya, aur woh bhi unhi ki apni kitab Torah ke qanoon ke mutabiq: jo mard larne wale hain unko saza-e-maut di jaye, aur aurton aur bachon ko qaid mein rakha jaye. Nabi ne farmaya ke tum ne wahi faisla kiya jo Allah ka faisla hai. Maqtoolon ki tadad par riwayat mukhtalif hain, kahin chaar sau aur kahin nau sau tak milti hai. Saad bin Muaz kuch din baad apne zakhm se shaheed ho gaye aur kehte hain ke unki wafat par Arsh hil gaya. Sabaq yeh hai ke ahd-shikni ki saza sakht hoti hai, aur is waqiye par tareekhi behs bhi hoti hai, is liye interview mein itna kehna kaafi hai ke riwayat mukhtalif hain.
Ghazwa 5: KHAIBAR (Muharram, 7 Hijri ≈ 628 AD)
Hudaibiya ka sulah ho chuka tha, Musalmanon ke dil mein sukoon tha, aur Nabi Madina wapas aa gaye thay. Magar Madina ke shumal mein taqreeban 150 kilometer door Khaibar, jo Yahoodiyon ka bara aur mazboot qilon wala ilaqa tha, wahan se achi khabar nahi aa rahi thi. Wahan woh Yahoodi bhi rehte thay jinhein Banu Nadir ke naam se Madina se nikala gaya tha, aur woh Ghatafan ke qabeele ke saath mil kar Madina par dobara hamla karne ki sazish kar rahe thay. Nabi ne Muharram 7 Hijri mein un ka rukh kiya. Lashkar mein wohi taqreeban 1,400 se 1,600 saathi thay jo Hudaibiya mein shareek thay, aur sau, do sau ghoray thay.
Khaibar ke Yahoodiyon ke paas saat aath mazboot qile thay: Naim, Qamus, Shiq, Natat, Katiba, Watih aur Sulalim. Un ke bade sardar aur pehlwan Marhab, us ka bhai Yasir aur Kinana bin Rabi thay. Musalmanon ne ek ek qila fatah karna shuru kiya, magar sab se mazboot qila Qamus tha, jo kai din tak nahi toota. Pehle din Nabi ne jhanda Abu Bakr ko diya, woh waapas aaye aur qila fatah na hua. Doosre din Umar ko diya, unse bhi qila fatah na hua. Tab Nabi ne farmaya: "Kal main jhanda aise shakhs ko dunga jise Allah aur uska Rasool chahte hain, aur jis par Allah fatah ata karega." Sab sahaba ne raat jaag kar guzari ke kal yeh sharaf kise milta hai.
Subah huyi to Nabi ne Ali (radiyallahu anhu) ko bulaya. Un ki aankhon mein sakht takleef thi aur woh dekh nahi pa rahe thay. Nabi ne apna lu'aab-e-mubarak un ki aankhon par lagaya to woh usi waqt theek ho gayin. Phir Nabi ne jhanda un ke hawale kar diya. Ali qile ke saamne pohanche to Yahoodi sardar Marhab, jo apni bahaduri par naaz karta tha, rajaz parhta hua muqable ke liye nikla. Mashhoor riwayat ke mutabiq Ali ne use mar diya (doosri riwayat mein Muhammad bin Maslama ka naam aata hai). Marhab ka bhai Yasir Zubair bin Awwam ke haath se mara gaya. Kehte hain ke ladai ke dauran Ali ke haath se dhaal gir gayi to unhon ne qile ka bhaari darwaza utha kar dhaal bana liya. Isi waqiye ko "Fatah-e-Khaibar" ke naam se yaad kiya jata hai.
Taqreeban ek mahine ke gherao ke baad Musalmanon ko fatah mili. Musalmanon ke taqreeban 15 se 18 log shaheed hue aur Yahoodiyon ke taqreeban 90 log maray gaye (aam riwayat). Sulah is shart par hui ke Yahoodi apni zameenon par rahenge aur paidawar ka adha hissa Musalmanon ko dete rahenge (batai ya muzara'at ka usool). Is mauqe par do aham waqiat pesh aaye. Zainab bint Harith ne Nabi ke liye bhuna hua gosht pesh kiya jis mein zahar milaya gaya tha. Bishr bin Bara ne usse khaya aur shaheed ho gaye, jabke Nabi ne pehla luqma hi thook diya. Doosra waqia yeh ke Safiyya bint Huyayy, jo ek Yahoodi sardar ki beti thin, musalman hui aur Nabi ne un se nikah kiya. Isi mauqe par Habsha se wapas aane wale Jafar bin Abi Talib aur doosre Muhajir bhi Madina pohanche. Sabaq: Hudaibiya ke sabr ka phal mila, imaan aur himmat kaam aati hai, aur Ali ki bahaduri misaal hai.
Ghazwa 6: FATAH MAKKA (Ramzan, 8 Hijri ≈ 630 AD)
Hudaibiya ke muahide mein tay hua tha ke das saal tak koi kisi par hamla nahi karega, aur qabeele jis ke ittehadi banna chahein ban sakte hain. Banu Khuza'a Musalmanon ke ittehadi ban gaye aur Banu Bakr Quraish ke. Magar Banu Bakr ne ek raat Banu Khuza'a par hamla kar diya aur Quraish ne unki madad ki, yahan tak ke Khuza'a ke log Haram mein panah lene par bhi maray gaye. Yeh Hudaibiya ka muahida todna tha. Khuza'a ke log fariyad le kar Madina aaye. Quraish ko apni ghalti ka ehsas hua to Abu Sufyan muahida bahal karwane Madina aaya, magar na Nabi ne, na Abu Bakr aur Umar ne, na Ali ne kuch sunna gawara kiya aur woh nakaam wapas gaya.
Nabi ne bohat khamoshi aur raazdari ke saath tayyari ki taake Quraish ko khabar na ho aur Makka mein khoon-rezi na ho. Ramzan 8 Hijri mein dus hazaar ka lashkar Madina se nikla, jo ab tak ka sab se bara lashkar tha. Marr-uz-Zahran ke maqam par raat ko saari fauj ne alag alag aag jalayi to puri wadi roshan ho gayi. Isi roz Abu Sufyan Makka se nikla aur Nabi ke chacha Abbas ke saath aa kar pakda gaya. Abbas ne use Nabi ke saamne pesh kiya aur us ne Islam qabool kar liya. Nabi ne Abu Sufyan ki izzat afzai ke liye elaan kiya: "Jo Abu Sufyan ke ghar mein chala jaye, ya Kaaba mein panah le, ya apne ghar ka darwaza band kar le, usay aman hai."
Lashkar chaar dasto mein Makka ki taraf barha. Khalid bin Waleed Makka ke neeche wale hisse ki taraf se, Zubair bin Awwam shumal ki taraf se, Abu Ubayda bin Jarrah beech ki wadi se aur Saad bin Ubada apne dasto ke saath aaye (baad mein jhanda unke bete Qais ko diya gaya). Sab ko hukm tha ke jab tak koi tum par hamla na kare, haath na uthana. Sirf Khandama ke maqam par Khalid bin Waleed ke saamne Ikrima bin Abu Jahl aur Safwan bin Umayya ne muqabla kiya. Is jhadap mein Quraish ke 13 log maray gaye aur do se teen Musalman, Kurz bin Jabir aur Khunais bin Khalid, shaheed hue. Baqi Makka bina khoon-rezi ke fatah ho gaya.
Nabi apni oont Qaswa par sar jhukaye hue Makka mein dakhil hue, itna jhukaye ke sar mubarak oont ke kajawe ko chhoo raha tha, aur Surah Fath ki tilawat farma rahe thay. Phir Kaaba pohanche, Tawaf kiya aur Kaaba mein rakhe 360 buton ko giraya, aur yeh ayat parhi: "Haq aa gaya aur batil mit gaya" (Surah Bani Israel, ayat 81). Bilal ne Kaaba ki chhat par chadh kar azan di. Nabi ne Uthman bin Talha ko bula kar Kaaba ki chabi unhi ko wapas kar di. Phir Nabi ne Quraish ke saamne khade ho kar farmaya: "Aaj tum par koi malamat nahi, jao tum sab azad ho." Yeh wohi alfaz thay jo Yusuf (alaihis salam) ne apne bhaiyon se kahe thay. Sirf chand logon (6 mard aur 4 aurtein) ke baare mein hukm tha, magar un mein se bhi kai ko baad mein maaf kar diya gaya. Ikrima, Wahshi aur Hind ne Islam qabool kiya. Sabaq: dushman ko maaf karna, Islam ki rehmat, aur aman ke saath fatah.
Ghazwa 7: HUNAIN (Shawwal, 8 Hijri ≈ 630 AD)
Makka fatah hua to Arab ke do taqatwar qabeele, Hawazin aur Thaqif (jo Taif mein rehte thay), ghabra gaye aur Musalmanon par hamle ka mansooba banane lage. Un ka jawan sardar Malik bin Auf Nasri tha. Us ne taqreeban 20,000 ka lashkar jama kiya (riwayat 4,000 se 20,000 tak milti hai) aur apni aurton, bachon aur maal ko bhi saath le liya taake koi maidan chhor kar bhaag na sake. Nabi 12,000 ka lashkar le kar nikle, jis mein 10,000 Madina walay aur 2,000 naye Makki thay. Itna bara lashkar pehle kabhi nahi tha, aur kuch logon ke dil mein kasrat ka ghurur aa gaya ke aaj hum haar nahi sakte (Surah Tawbah, ayat 25).
Makka aur Taif ke darmiyan Wadi-e-Hunain ek tang aur utarai wali ghati thi. Malik bin Auf ne apne teer-andazon ko subah ke andhere mein ghati ke dono kinaron par chhupa diya tha. Jaise hi Musalmanon ka lashkar wadi mein utra, achanak teeron ki barish shuru ho gayi. Naye aur ghabraye hue sipahi bhag nikle, oont ek doosre se takraye aur lashkar bikhar gaya. Nabi apni khachchar Duldul par maidan mein jame rahe, aur taqreeban sau sahaba, jin mein Abu Bakr, Umar, Ali, Abbas aur Abu Sufyan bin Harith thay, un ke saath dute rahe.
Nabi ne bulandi awaaz se farmaya: "Main nabi hoon, yeh jhoot nahi; main Abdul Muttalib ka beta hoon." Phir Abbas ki baland awaaz mein Ansar aur Muhajir ko pukara gaya: "Ai Ansar ke logo! Ai bait-e-Ridwan walo!" Yeh awaaz sun kar sahaba dobara palat aaye aur dushman par toot pade. Nabi ne mutthi bhar kankar dushman ki taraf phenke aur Allah ne unki aankhon mein dhool ki tarah bhar diye. Dushman ke qadam ukhar gaye aur woh bhaag nikla. Ghanimat mein taqreeban 6,000 qaidi, 24,000 oont, 40,000 se zyada bakriyan aur 4,000 uqiya chandi haath aayi.
Is ke baad Nabi ka husn-e-sulook dekhne ke qabil tha. Hawazin ka wafd aaya aur Islam qabool kiya. Un mein Nabi ki dudh-sharik behan Shaima bhi thin. Nabi ne sab qaidi wapas kar diye. Naye musalmanon (muallafatul quloob) ko ghanimat mein zyada hissa diya taake un ke dil jeete jayen. Ansar ke kuch naujawano ne shikayat ki to Nabi ne unhein jama kar ke aisi pyari taqreer ki ke sab ro pare aur kehne lage ke humein bas Allah ke Rasool hi chahiye. Hunain ke baad Nabi ne Taif ka gherao kiya (taqreeban 18 se 20 din, kuch riwayat mein 40 din), magar qila fatah na hua aur Nabi wapas chale gaye. Taif ka wafd 9 Hijri mein khud Islam laya. Sabaq: ghurur par Allah ki girift, sabr aur Nabi ki shaja'at.
Ghazwa 8: TABUK (Rajab, 9 Hijri ≈ 630 AD)
Madina mein khabar pohanchi ke Roman (Byzantine) badshah Heraclius (Hiraql) Syria ki sarhad par bari fauj jama kar raha hai taake Musalmanon par hamla kare. Mausam sakht garmi ka tha, fasal pakne ke din thay, Madina se Tabuk ka safar taqreeban 700 kilometer lamba tha, aur sawariyon aur khane ki sakht tangi thi. Isi liye is lashkar ko "Jaish-ul-Usrat" yani tangi wala lashkar kaha gaya. Nabi ne is baar saaf elaan kar diya ke manzil kahan hai taake log poori tayyari kar sakein, aur madad ki apeal ki.
Is apeal par sahaba ne bepanah qurbaniyan di. Usman (radiyallahu anhu) ne lashkar ka bara hissa taqreeban 900 se 950 oont, 50 ghoray aur 1,000 dinar (aam riwayat) pesh kiye. Abu Bakr apna sara maal le aaye aur jab Nabi ne poocha ke ghar mein kya chhora, to jawab diya: "Allah aur uska Rasool." Umar apna adha maal le aaye. Aurton ne apne zewar utaar kar de diye. Is tarah 30,000 ka lashkar tayyar hua jis mein 10,000 ghoray aur bohat se oont thay, magar phir bhi sawariyon ki kami thi. Nabi ne Madina mein apna nigran Ali (radiyallahu anhu) ko banaya. Munafiqeen ne taana diya to Ali ro kar Nabi ke paas aaye, aur Nabi ne farmaya: "Tum mere liye aise ho jaise Harun, Moosa ke liye."
Peechay reh jane walon mein munafiqeen (taqreeban 80 se zyada) jhoote bahane bana kar ruk gaye. Teen sachche sahaba, Kaab bin Malik, Murara bin Rabi aur Hilal bin Umayya, sust ho kar ruk gaye. Jab Nabi wapas aaye to unhon ne sach bola. Un ka 50 din tak mukammal bayqot hua, zameen un par tang ho gayi, aur phir Allah ne un ki tauba qabool farmai (Surah Tawbah, ayat 118).
Lashkar Tabuk pohancha to Heraclius peechay hat chuka tha aur koi jang nahi hui. Nabi ne taqreeban 20 din Tabuk mein qiyam kiya. Is dauran Ayla ke hakim Yuhanna bin Ruba, Jarba aur Adhruh ke logon ne jizya par muahide kiye aur aman paya. Khalid bin Waleed ko Dumat-ul-Jandal bheja gaya, jahan ke hakim Ukaidir ko pakad kar muahida kiya gaya. Wapsi par Madina ke qareeb munafiqeen ki banayi hui Masjid-e-Dirar ko, jo Musalmanon mein phoot dalne ke liye bani thi, tod diya gaya. Yeh Nabi ka aakhri ghazwa tha. Sabaq: qurbani, imaan ka imtihaan, aur sacha aur jhoota musalman alag ho jata hai.
